# The build context is the whole workspace, so everything that a container must build
# for itself is excluded here. Without this, the host's node_modules - macOS or Windows
# binaries, in the worst case - would be copied over the image's own install.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
dist
**/dist
.output
**/.output
.nuxt
**/.nuxt
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.remember
docker/data
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
